      "title": "High number of new and inexperienced directors",
      "body": "There are 4 new directors who have joined the board in the last 3 years. The company's board is composed of: 4 new directors. No experienced directors. No highly experienced directors. Non-Executive Independent Woman Director Priyanka Singh is the most experienced director on the board, commencing their role in 2024. The company’s lack of experienced directors is considered a risk according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model.",
